cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "QuasarChain Quantum Experiment Passport"
message: "If you use this software or the Bell-state laboratory in academic work, please cite this repository."
type: software
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: 2026-09-30
authors:
  - name: "QuasarChain contributors"
abstract: >-
  Educational prototype for recording the provenance and integrity of a
  reproducible Bell-state experiment using canonical circuit hashing and
  Ed25519 signatures. The prototype does not claim experimental quantum
  physics results or hardware equivalence.
keywords:
  - quantum computing
  - reproducibility
  - data provenance
  - experimental integrity
  - Ed25519
  - Bell state
